<Mod id="f6859d5b-50bf-4a7e-b5d3-bdc2d6e69392" version="11">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Cool Wacky Civs 2</Name>
    <Teaser>Nine civilizations: an endless city, wings, a champion, a lobby, prayer, clockwork, a circus, eleven cats and Saba.</Teaser>
    <Description>The Boundless City, The Republic of Pigeons, The Indigo Champion, McPvP - The Endless Lobby, The Children of the Kingdom, The Twelfth Hour, The Wandering Circus, The 11 Cats and The Kingdom of Saba. Requires BNW and Community Patch v151. See the included civilization guides.</Description>
    <Authors>SolusGo</Authors>
    <Homepage>https://github.com/SolusGo/CoolWackyCivs2</Homepage>
    <AffectsSavedGames>1</AffectsSavedGames>
